  "title": "Blackened Catfish and Spicy Rice",
  "description": "In this delicious catfish and rice recipe, buttery pan-fried catfish fillets are served over a bed of spicy white rice to make a quick dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Eric Lubow"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-07-10T03:03:29-04:00",
